    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stepping back feels like it won't be enough. i keep thinking that even if i just stay quiet or stay away, the damage i've already caused is there. they'll always be dealing with the fallout of me being around. it feels like a cycle that just won't end unless something drastic changes. like, how do you actually fix being the problem?",
